        "heading_2": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "We make a few good things",
            "tag": "h1",
            "size_desktop": 56,
            "size_mobile": 36
          }
        },
        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Sundry started in 2019 with one mug we could not find anywhere else. Now it is three of us in a small studio, making the things we use every day: something to drink from, something to carry, something to write in.</p><p>We keep the range short and the runs small, and we would rather make one thing well than ten things quickly.</p>"
          }
        },
